WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.795 --> 00:00:05.589
You tried this Morpho machine?

00:00:05.672 --> 00:00:08.383
That thing will tell you
your life's potential.

00:00:08.884 --> 00:00:10.135
This is something
that gives people hope.

00:00:10.219 --> 00:00:12.513
It just tells you your whole reason
for existing on Earth.

00:00:13.472 --> 00:00:14.431
Everyone is trying it.

00:00:14.515 --> 00:00:16.475
It's something that might be
too good to be true.

00:00:18.060 --> 00:00:19.186
This machine is--

00:00:19.269 --> 00:00:20.729
-Validating.
-Mysterious.

00:00:20.812 --> 00:00:21.688
-Magic.
-Unknown.

00:00:21.772 --> 00:00:22.606
-Dream.
-Fate.

00:00:22.689 --> 00:00:24.691
-Destiny.
-Your future.

00:00:25.984 --> 00:00:28.028
This machine is reminding people

00:00:28.111 --> 00:00:30.614
our lives have more than
one possible path.

00:00:33.492 --> 00:00:35.035
What are you waiting for?

00:00:35.118 --> 00:00:35.953
Give it a whirl.

